  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Pyrethrum Market System Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder farmers increase investment in their farming businesses as a result of improved agricultural market access, and training courses that delivers business and financial management and skills development (TVET).
The outcome of the project is planned to be that SME agribusinesses provide a range of market services to smallholder farmers on a sustainable and profitable basis.</narrative>
  </description>
